{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05821","headline":"奉和圣制御春明楼临右相园亭赋乐贤诗应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制御春明楼临右相园亭赋乐贤诗应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"复道通长乐，青门临上路。\n遥闻凤吹喧，闇识龙舆度。\n褰旒明四目，伏槛纡三顾。\n小苑接侯家，飞甍暎宫树。\n商山原上碧，滻水林端素。\n银汉下天章，琼筵承湛露。\n将非富人宠，信以平戎故。\n从来简帝心，讵得回天步。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}